  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 wu akiwe ehenhla ka sofoweya ya open-source leyi tsariweke hi vanhu. Yi tshamisiwe laha hikuva a yi endliwanga hi AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 i phurojeke leyi endliweke hinkwayo hi AI.<\/0> Layini ni layini ya khodi ya Orion-81 n'wini yi tsariwe hi Claude Code, hi nkongomiso wa muvumbi. Xikepe ni xikepe, mepe ni mepe, texture ni mpfumawulo hinkwaswo swi endliwe hi switirhisiwa leswi Claude Code swi swi tsaleke. Muvumbi u anakanyisa leswi swi ta akiwa; Claude Code yi kuma ndlela ya ku swi aka. Ma layibrari ya open-source lawa yi akiweke ehenhla ka wona ma tshamisiwe laha hansi ka 'A swi endliwanga hi AI'. Xiyenge xin'we xa ha tshama xi pfuriwile naswona xi kombisiwa erivaleni: <1>ku kambisisiwa ka layisense<\/1> ya khodi ya ntlangu leyi suke eka prototayipi ya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion yi sungule hi 28 Ndzhati 2026 tanihi prototayipi eka enjini ya open-source ya Quake III Arena (GPL), ni swikepe swa Elite Dangerous swi ri xihlovo xa mianakanyo. Hi siku ra vumbirhi khodi ya ntlangu yi hundzele eka BuB, enjini leyintshwa leyi tsariweke hi Claude Code; timojula ta ntlangu ti suke eka prototayipi naswona ti thiriweke mavito lamantshwa. Vhezini 0.3.0 yi nyikile tikalasi hinkwato ta 16 ta swikepe tikhumba tintshwa ta tona. Ku kambisisiwa ka ku landzelela layisense ku kambisisa loko khodi yin'wana yi ha sukeke eka GPL yo sungula, ni loko vuvumbi bya swikepe bya le ku sunguleni byi tshama swinene ni xihlovo xa byona. Ku kambisisiwa ka ku fana ka khodi loku endliweke hi xitirhisiwa ku ya hi xihlovo xa prototayipi ya GPL ku endliwile hi 8 Nhlangula 2026, naswona ku kambisisiwa ka vativi ka leswi swi kumiweke ku ya emahlweni. Xin'wana ni xin'wana lexi suke eka xona xi ta tsariwa nakambe kumbe xi vumbiwa nakambe.",
