  "economy.diagram.desc": "Ndlela ya ku kuma: tlanga minhlangano, u kuma mali ya ntlangu. Ndlela ya ku xava: mali ya xiviri yi xava mali ya ntlangu. Tindlela hinkwato timbirhi ti yisa endhawini yin'we: swikepe, switlakusi swa swikepe ni swo kucetela, kutani ku tlhelela eka minhlangano. Swi kunguhatiwile, a swi akiwanga.",
