  "meta.description": "Orion-81 i ntlangu wa nyimpi ya le tibakabakeni lowu endliweke hinkwawo hi AI, leswaku mali leyi wu yi kumaka yi ta hirisa vadizayini va swifaniso ni vaenjiniyela va sofoweya lava lahleke ntirho hikwalaho ka AI. Kambisisa swikepe, timepe ni matlhari leswi akiweke ku fikela sweswi.",
