  "mission.countsOrion81": "Swi hlayisa khodi ni switirhisiwa swa Orion-81 n'wini, ku katsa logo. Ma layibrari ya open-source lawa yi ma tirhisaka ma tshamisiwe ehansi ka <0>'A swi endliwanga hi AI'<\/0>. Hinkwaswo leswi akiweke ku fikela sweswi swi endliwe hi AI. Loko mudizayini a tshama exikhundleni xa xiyenge, pheji leri ri ta swi vula, ni vito ra yena.",
  "mission.countsOrion812": "Swi hlayiwa swa khodi ni switirhisiwa swa Orion-81 n'wini; ma layibrari ya van'wana a ya katsiwi. Mafayili ma hlayiwa eka ku akiwa ka 0.6.1.",
