  "proof.since202610": "Ku sukela hi 2026-10-03 (vhezini 0.2.1 ku ya emahlweni), modele wa mukunguhati (Claude Opus 5.5) wu tsala pulani ni swiphemu swa ku amukeriwa eka tracker. Timodele ta vatirhisi (Claude Sonnet 5.5) ti aka hi nkarhi wun'we, yin'wana ni yin'wana eka tifayili ta yona. Mukunguhati u kambisisa, vatirhisi va lulamisa, swikambelo swa tirha, kutani ntsena vhezini yi hlayisiwa. Tivhezini ta khale (v0 ku ya eka 0.2.0) ti kunguhatiwile ni ku akiwa hi Claude Code hi modele wun'we.",
