  "styles.barsCapLog": "Bara yin'wana ni yin'wana yi suka eka nkoka lowutsongo ku ya eka lowukulu exikarhi ka swikepe swa kalasi yoleyo (xikalo xa log, leswaku tikalasi leti tsongo ti tshama ti vonaka). Hlawula mpimo.",
