  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Economic Index ya Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> yi kuma leswaku vatirhi va ku sungula ntirho va vona ntirho wo tala wa vona wu nga endliwa hi AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Mfumo wa pholisi ya ikhonomi ya Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> wu kombela tinkampani ku dyondzisa nakambe ni ku tirhisa vanhu eka mintirho yin'wana ku ri na ku cheka.",
